From 10489a39c0295b514bf32bb4d8d86f93ea254306 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:43:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/22] Types: the save code (game-state.js) is type-checked

// @ts-check (npm run modules marks its generated setters; the test mode's and the full test's own setters are
marked by hand), and JSDoc types: newSave() returns SaveData, migrate() and loadSave() take a stored save and
return SaveData or null, so saveData and everything here that reads or fills the save is checked against
game/types/save-data.d.ts. Casts where the code knows more than the types (a species with an evolution has a next
stage, a plan's next location is a road away), each with a comment. Comments and parentheses only: the syntax tree
is unchanged.
---
 game/js/game-state.js | 104 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 89 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

